# Copy this file to .env (gitignored, never committed) and set the real path for
# your machine. docker-compose.yml requires TRAINING_DATA_DIR and will refuse to run
# with a clear error if it's unset - there's no baked-in default, since a hardcoded
# path only ever makes sense on the machine it was written for.
#
# Should point at a convert_shuffled.py output directory (train/, val/, test/ of
# shard_*.h5 - see DATA_PIPELINE.md for how those are produced), which will be
# mounted read-only at /data inside the container - matching what every training
# script here expects.
TRAINING_DATA_DIR=/path/to/your/katago-selfplay
